<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!--
  Status bar icon for ClipMesh's notifications.

  Android status bar icons are silhouettes: only the alpha channel is used and
  the system tints them, so this is deliberately a single flat white shape with
  no colours of its own.

  The shape is a clipboard, which is what the app is about and - unlike the
  `android.R.drawable.stat_sys_upload` this replaced - it does not read as
  "something is uploading". That system drawable is the up-arrow that appears in
  the status bar during a download or upload, so a persistent ClipMesh
  notification looked like a transfer that never finished.
-->
